  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Pill It Up — Affiliate Program Description</strong></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>About Our Brand and Products</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">Pill It Up is a US-based pill organizer and pill case brand built for people who take their health routine seriously — without wanting their medicine cabinet to look like one.</p><p class=\"p1\">We sell daily, weekly, monthly, and travel pill organizers designed to fit real life. Whether you're managing vitamins, prescriptions, or supplements, we have an organizer that works for your routine.</p><p class=\"p1\">Our products ship to the US, UK, and EU, and are loved by 7,000+ customers with a 4.9-star average rating.</p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>What Makes Us Different</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">Most pill organizers are ugly, cheap, and something you hide in a drawer. Ours aren't.</p><p class=\"p1\">- <strong>BPA-free plastic</strong>— safe materials for your daily health routine, no compromises</p><p class=\"p1\">- <strong>High-quality aluminium</strong> — for customers who want something that feels premium and lasts</p><p class=\"p1\">-<strong>Cute, aesthetic designs</strong> — pill cases people actually want to leave on their counter</p><p class=\"p1\">- Price range from $6.99 to $49.99 — easy entry point, strong conversion</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">- <strong>20% commission</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>on every order placed through your link</p><p class=\"p1\">-<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span><strong>30-day cookie window</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>— if someone clicks your link and buys within 30 days, you earn</p><p class=\"p1\">-<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>Payouts on the <strong>1st and 15th</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>of every month, no minimum amount required.</p><p class=\"p1\">-<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span><strong>$500 bonus</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>for any affiliate who drives <strong>$5,000+</strong> in total revenue in a month.</p><p class=\"p1\">There are no caps and no minimums. The more you sell, the more you earn.</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><strong>How to Promote Us</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">We provide<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>discount codes<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>you can share with your audience — giving them a reason to buy through you specifically.</p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"><strong> </strong></span><strong>Allowed traffic sources:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p class=\"p1\">- Blogs and content sites</p><p class=\"p1\">- Social media (organic posts, reels, stories)</p><p class=\"p1\">- Social media ads</p><p class=\"p1\">- Email marketing</p><p class=\"p1\">- YouTube and video content</p><p class=\"p1\">- Communities and forums</p><p class=\"p1\">- Comparison shopping sites</p><p class=\"p1\">- Display banners</p><p class=\"p1\">- Social messenger apps</p><p class=\"p1\">- Coupon and discount code sites</p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"><strong> </strong></span><strong>Not allowed:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"><strong> </strong></span></p><p class=\"p1\">- SEO / search engine manipulation</p><p class=\"p1\">- Search ads (Google, Bing PPC)</p><p class=\"p1\">- Cashback sites</p><p class=\"p1\">- Incentivized traffic or loyalty schemes</p><p class=\"p1\">- Browser extensions or software</p><p class=\"p1\">- Push notifications</p><p class=\"p1\">- Adult or pornographic content</p><p class=\"p1\">- Brand bidding (PPC ads using \"Pill It Up\" as a keyword)</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>Other Information</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">How to join:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>Simply sign up through our affiliate app — no lengthy application, no approval wait. You're in as soon as you sign up.</p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"><strong> </strong></span><strong>Who's a good fit</strong>:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>Health and wellness creators, productivity and routine content, lifestyle bloggers, family and parenting content, travel creators. If your audience has a daily routine, they need a Pill It Up.</p><p class=\"p2\">No minimum follower count required<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>— we care about audience fit, not audience size.</p><p class=\"p1\">Questions? </p><p class=\"p1\">Contact us at support@pillitup.shop</p><p><br></p></div></div>",
